  "description": "OEDRO Running Boards are engineered exclusively compatible with 2024–2026 Tesla Cybertruck, blending seamlessly with its angular lines and stainless steel chassis. Built from heavy-duty carbon steel, these side steps provide unmatched durability, 600 lbs load capacity, and a futuristic look. The functional panel design boosts visual appeal while preventing water and debris buildup. Triple-layer black powder coating resists rust, UV damage, and wear, ensuring reliable use in all weather. Quick, no-drill installation completes the package for a perfect upgrade to your Cybertruck.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Cybertruck: Precisely contoured for the 2024–2025 Tesla Cybertruck’s angular body and stainless steel frame, ensuring a flawless aesthetic match.\nPremium Carbon Steel Strength: Heavy-duty build supports up to 600 lbs, delivering maximum stability and safety when entering or exiting.\nAdvanced Functional Design: Raised ends with a lower center and hollow panel slots prevent water, dirt, and debris accumulation.\nTriple-Layer Protection: Black powder-coated finish offers anti-slip grip, rust resistance, UV shielding, and wear protection in harsh climates.\nFast No-Drill Install: Includes all brackets, hardware, and instructions for a 30-minute setup without cutting or drilling.\n1-Year Warranty & Professional Installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2026 Tesla Cybertruck",
